WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.998
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Word: Type and Save a Document.

2
00:00:06.298 --> 00:00:10.529
Write a short letter and save it. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.517 --> 00:00:14.993
Step one. Open Word and choose Blank document.

4
00:00:15.983 --> 00:00:20.287
Step two. Click on the page and type your letter. Press Enter for a new line.

5
00:00:21.283 --> 00:00:26.202
Step three. Press Control and S to save. The Save window opens.

6
00:00:27.217 --> 00:00:36.037
Step four. Type a clear file name, choose the Documents folder, and click Save. Press Control S again as you work to keep your changes.

7
00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:40.736
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:41.036 --> 00:00:43.465
Write a four-line letter.

9
00:00:43.765 --> 00:00:45.915
Save it as My Letter in Documents.

10
00:00:46.215 --> 00:00:48.412
Close Word, then open the file again.

11
00:00:48.712 --> 00:00:49.736
Well done!

